{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reggie the vampire is dognapping puppies and must be stopped! As Van Helsing, embark on a journey around the world to rescue the pups: from haunted mansions and museums to ghoulish graveyards, each stage is packed with unique challenges to overcome and secrets to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818130/extras/a7d754926ccf49f33c7bcff51465375c.poster.avif?t=1765129279\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818130/extras/a7d754926ccf49f33c7bcff51465375c.webm?t=1765129279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818130/extras/a7d754926ccf49f33c7bcff51465375c.mp4?t=1765129279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Man's Best Friend:</strong> Van Helsing's faithful hound Silver can be summoned during stages to attack enemies - and even drive vehicles?! Any baddies hit with Silver will drop delicious bonus items that boost your score, so make the most of your canine pal's help.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818130/extras/2a96ceb5665dc894909310338ebcaea9.avif?t=1765129279\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock &amp; Upgrade:</strong> Grab gold coins hidden in stages to buy power-ups that will aid you in your quest. Collect enough coins to unlock the extra puzzle game mode Terror Blocks! Bonus items collected, challenges completed and secret items uncovered all count towards your progress to unlock extra weapons, from a zombie shredding shotgun to the devastating rocket launcher!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818130/extras/c679455f335aa9cfb84c5ec940c08d73.avif?t=1765129279\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818130/extras_big/c679455f335aa9cfb84c5ec940c08d73.avif?t=1765129279 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top Dog:</strong>\u00a0Arcade Mode and Terror Blocks both have online leaderboards, allowing you to track your progress and compete for the best score. And for those who'd rather show off their skills live, the game's low memory footprint keeps streams silky smooth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818130/extras/4eed90e53f9f84ff061cdfda82126591.avif?t=1765129279\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control &amp; Conquer</strong>: With game design based on &quot;Cabal Shooters&quot; like Wild Guns Reloaded, Silver Bullet has extensive control customisation. Play with modern twin stick aiming or classic single stick using a gamepad, go retro with an arcade stick or focus on precision with a keyboard and mouse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818130/extras/f9cde6c8126d170f62ca1c5b08aa088a.avif?t=1765129279\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818130/extras_big/f9cde6c8126d170f62ca1c5b08aa088a.avif?t=1765129279 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-school Cool:</strong>\u00a0With personality filled pixel art, customisable retro screen filters and\u00a0 spooky synth-pop bops from the legendary YM2612 chip, Silver Bullet looks and sounds like a long-lost 16-bit classic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818130/extras/b614282b7d4bae775e2188d959dedfa4.avif?t=1765129279\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818130/extras_big/b614282b7d4bae775e2188d959dedfa4.avif?t=1765129279 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Toil And Trouble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2818130/5069a2d69788113790885813115e2ac5230d34f4.jpg"},{"name":"I Ain't Afraid of No GHOST","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2818130/c80a1d3b183fcd7540f0e96c7279f409e059b187.jpg"},{"name":"Who's a Good Boy?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2818130/30e98a6b6312e3fe248ac11b8a7bed2c65e61e24.jpg"},{"name":"Close Encounters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2818130/9292535e4b027ed964f8ccd1d27b7c08b286f363.jpg"},{"name":"Count Dracula","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2818130/eb9f8a5d21b727417950c9456715d9e6faf46757.jpg"},{"name":"Cleopatra's Fortune","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2818130/655a9dc17adc5b6dd9118e27131fbe9438cb6448.jpg"},{"name":"Afterlife Finds a Way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2818130/f632acf9f4943d4ef40df33156bc5a885ee9bd2f.jpg"},{"name":"Eight Legged Freaks"